{
  "_comment": "Layout is defined in engine/include/pron/pron_engine.h. kind=file: single download to dest. kind=tar_voice: tar.bz2 (sherpa-onnx Piper voice) extracted into dest dir, the single *.onnx renamed to model.onnx, tokens.txt and espeak-ng-data/ kept. kind=tar_asr: tar.bz2 (sherpa-onnx streaming transducer) whose files are picked by the 'pick' globs (first matching alternative, int8 preferred) and installed under the given names in dest (live/{encoder,decoder,joiner}.onnx, tokens.txt). kind=export: built by tools/export_phoneme_model.py. sha256 null = unknown (computed hash is printed; paste it here to pin). whisper: q5_1-quantized base.en, the only ggml-*.bin kept in whisper/ (exclusive_glob). cmudict tracks master (no commit pin available offline).",
